  ["SimulationCraft publishes no rotation for most healing specs (Discipline, Holy Priest, Holy Paladin, Mistweaver, Restoration Shaman, Preservation). For those DMGAssist has its own damage lists, learned from the current class guides, for your damage between heals (SimC's list replaces ours as soon as it publishes one). Healing stays your call. Interrupts, defensives with your boss mod, on-use trinkets, keybinds and your spell choices all work. Restoration Druid has a full SimC list, including cat weaving. A spec with no list at all (some on WoW Forever) follows Blizzard's Assisted Combat."] = "SimulationCraft 沒有為大多數治療專精（戒律、神聖牧師、神聖聖騎士、織霧、恢復薩滿、護存）釋出循環。DMGAssist 為它們準備了自己的輸出列表，取自當前的職業指南，用於治療間隙的輸出（SimC 一旦釋出列表就會替換我們的）。治療仍由你決定。打斷、配合首領插件的減傷、飾品、按鍵和你的技能選擇都能用。恢復德魯伊有完整的 SimC 列表，包括貓形態輸出。完全沒有列表的專精（部分 Forever 專精）跟隨暴雪的輔助戰鬥。",
